Package: shizuku-semi-auto
Version: 1.2.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: estebanalpha
Depends: android-tools
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Semi-automatic Shizuku activation via ADB loopback (Termux:Boot)
 Runs adb-connect and shizuku-watchdog at boot. Android 10-: detects
 "adb tcpip" mode from a second device and re-activates Shizuku. Android
 11+: shizuku-pair helper for wireless-debugging pairing. Version-aware
 Shizuku start (13.6+ libshizuku.so glob, V4+ user_de, V3.x sdcard) and
 USB priming gated to Android 10 and below.
